      "start": 30.5095,
      "audioStart": 30.5095,
      "audioDuration": 3.6674,
      "end": 34.1769,
      "duration": 3.6674,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c6",
      "text": "中间证书，相当于 CA 的分包商。",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 34.6769,
      "audioStart": 34.6769,
      "audioDuration": 2.4182,
      "end": 37.0951,
      "duration": 2.4182,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c7",
      "text": "这 8 张证书的私钥，本该是一个 384 位的随机数。",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 37.4951,
      "audioStart": 37.4951,
      "audioDuration": 3.3357,
      "end": 40.8308,
      "duration": 3.3357,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c8",
      "text": "实际只有 8 位。几毫秒，就能试完。",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 41.2808,
      "audioStart": 41.2808,
      "audioDuration": 3.1012,
      "end": 44.382,
      "duration": 3.1012,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c9",
      "text": "这 8 张证书，能签任何域名，包括你的银行网站。",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 44.982,
      "audioStart": 44.982,
      "audioDuration": 3.5362,
      "end": 48.5183,
      "duration": 3.5362,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "text": "10 月 17 日，研究者公开了私钥签名。",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 50.3683,
      "audioStart": 50.3683,
      "audioDuration": 2.9097,
      "end": 53.278,
      "duration": 2.9097,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "text": "Chrome 在 100 分钟内，拉黑了这 8 张证书。",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 53.678,
      "audioStart": 53.678,
      "audioDuration": 2.5259,
      "end": 56.2038,
      "duration": 2.5259,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "text": "Firefox 在 3 小时后跟进。",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 56.7038,
      "audioStart": 56.7038,
      "audioDuration": 1.8225,
      "end": 58.5264,
      "duration": 1.8225,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "text": "第二天，eMudhra 正式吊销。",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 59.0264,
      "audioStart": 59.0264,
      "audioDuration": 2.1859,
      "end": 61.2123,
      "duration": 2.1859,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "text": "这可能是互联网史上最快的一次证书响应。",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 61.7123,
      "audioStart": 61.7123,
      "audioDuration": 2.4684,
      "end": 64.1807,
      "duration": 2.4684,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "text": "浏览器全绿。安全了？",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 64.6807,
      "audioStart": 64.6807,
      "audioDuration": 1.9245,
      "end": 66.6052,
      "duration": 1.9245,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "text": "真的吗？",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 67.2052,
      "audioStart": 67.2052,
      "audioDuration": 0.3941,
      "end": 67.5993,
      "duration": 0.3941,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b1",
      "text": "吊销，只是一张通缉令。有些客户端，根本不看。",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 70.0993,
      "audioStart": 70.0993,
      "audioDuration": 3.7333,
      "end": 73.8326,
      "duration": 3.7333,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b2",
      "text": "macOS 自带的 curl、git、python3，只认根证书，不查吊销。",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 74.2826,
      "audioStart": 74.2826,
      "audioDuration": 4.7656,
      "end": 79.0482,
      "duration": 4.7656,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b3",
      "text": "各种开发工具、运行时、桌面客户端，各带一份信任库。系统更新，它们不会变。",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 79.4982,
      "audioStart": 79.4982,
      "audioDuration": 6.4547,
      "end": 85.9529,
      "duration": 6.4547,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b4",
      "text": "飞书、办公软件、各种智能助手，也在等更新。",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 86.4529,
      "audioStart": 86.4529,
      "audioDuration": 3.6059,
      "end": 90.0588,
      "duration": 3.6059,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b5",
      "text": "前门锁了，窗户还开着。",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 90.5088,
      "audioStart": 90.5088,
      "audioDuration": 1.6682,
      "end": 92.177,
      "duration": 1.6682,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b6",
      "text": "一扇窗没关，整栋房子都漏风。",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 92.677,
      "audioStart": 92.677,
      "audioDuration": 2.4436,
      "end": 95.1205,
      "duration": 2.4436,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "d1",
      "text": "为了证明，我做了个工具：Distrust。",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 96.8705,
      "audioStart": 96.8705,
      "audioDuration": 2.2039,
      "end": 99.0745,
      "duration": 2.2039,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "d2",
      "text": "一台电脑，一部手机，连同一个热点。",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 99.4745,
      "audioStart": 99.4745,
      "audioDuration": 2.484,
      "end": 101.9585,
      "duration": 2.484,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "d3",
      "text": "手机冒充网关，流量拐进手机。",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 102.3585,
      "audioStart": 102.3585,
      "audioDuration": 2.3776,
      "end": 104.7361,
      "duration": 2.3776,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "d7",
      "text": "聊天记录，一条一条出现在另一块屏幕上。",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 105.2361,
      "audioStart": 105.2361,
      "audioDuration": 2.6778,
      "end": 107.9139,
      "duration": 2.6778,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "d8",
      "text": "还能篡改。替你给老板发一句——",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 108.3139,
      "audioStart": 108.3139,
      "audioDuration": 2.3136,
      "end": 110.6275,
      "duration": 2.3136,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "d8b",
      "text": "老子不干了。",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "attacker",
      "start": 111.1275,
      "audioStart": 111.1275,
      "audioDuration": 0.9173,
      "end": 112.0447,
      "duration": 0.9173,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "d9",
      "text": "而你的屏幕，一切正常。",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 113.0447,
      "audioStart": 113.0447,
      "audioDuration": 1.7861,
      "end": 114.8308,
      "duration": 1.7861,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "d10",
      "text": "这还只是其中一个应用。同一个口子，还能干别的。",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 115.4308,
      "audioStart": 115.4308,
      "audioDuration": 3.5567,
      "end": 118.9875,
      "duration": 3.5567,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "x2",
      "text": "你让智能助手写代码，它可能替你执行一条删库命令。",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 120.8875,
      "audioStart": 120.8875,
      "audioDuration": 3.6788,
      "end": 124.5663,
      "duration": 3.6788,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "x3",
      "text": "你连的免费节点，可能正在偷看你的密码。",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 125.0663,
      "audioStart": 125.0663,
      "audioDuration": 2.6355,
      "end": 127.7018,
      "duration": 2.6355,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "x4",
      "text": "你的银行凭证，可能正躺在别人屏幕上。",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 128.2018,
      "audioStart": 128.2018,
      "audioDuration": 2.4279,
      "end": 130.6297,
      "duration": 2.4279,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "x5",
      "text": "一个没更新的客户端，就够了。",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 131.1297,
      "audioStart": 131.1297,
      "audioDuration": 1.9432,
      "end": 133.0729,
      "duration": 1.9432,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "x6",
      "text": "你以为的安全，只是因为还没人对你出手。",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 133.5729,
      "audioStart": 133.5729,
      "audioDuration": 2.7202,
      "end": 136.2931,
      "duration": 2.7202,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "f1",
      "text": "记住两件事。",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 137.9931,
      "audioStart": 137.9931,
      "audioDuration": 0.8232,
      "end": 138.8163,
      "duration": 0.8232,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "f2",
      "text": "第一，保持更新。系统、浏览器、旧软件，一个都别漏。",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 139.2163,
      "audioStart": 139.2163,
      "audioDuration": 4.5635,
      "end": 143.7798,
      "duration": 4.5635,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "f3",
      "text": "第二，别连陌生热点，尤其别登录账号。",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 144.2798,
      "audioStart": 144.2798,
      "audioDuration": 3.0484,
      "end": 147.3282,
      "duration": 3.0484,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "f4",
      "text": "现在，去更新。",
      "speak": null,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "start": 147.9282,
      "audioStart": 147.9282,
      "audioDuration": 1.2151,
      "end": 149.1433,
      "duration": 1.2151,
      "hold": false
    },
    {
      "id": "f_end",
      "text": "",
      "start": 149.9433,
      "audioStart": null,
      "audioDuration": 0,
      "end": 155.4433,
      "duration": 5.5,
      "hold": true
    }
  ]
}